  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to unravel patterns is extremely advanced.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Disruption.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your disrupt pattern ability deals an additional point of damage per die equal to half your mythic tier (minimum 1.) You can expend one use of mythic power when using disrupt pattern to maximize the damage of the ability, treating all dice rolled as the maximum value possible.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
